  "question": {
    "text": "For different values of $\\alpha$, the locus of the point of intersection of the two straight lines $\\sqrt{3} x-y-4 \\sqrt{3} \\alpha=0$ and $\\sqrt{3} \\alpha x+\\alpha y-4 \\sqrt{3}=0$ is",
    "image": null
